@startuml
!include _style.iuml
title NTUST Eats — Sprint 1 Domain Sketch (just enough design)
hide empty members
left to right direction
class Store {
  name
  slotCapacity
}
class MenuItem {
  name
  campusPrice
  offCampusPrice
}
class BowlBuilder {
  broth
  pick4[4]
}
class Cart
class Order {
  no
  status
  slot
}
Store *-- MenuItem
Cart --> MenuItem
Cart --> BowlBuilder
Cart ..> Order : 依店拆單
Order --> Store
note bottom of Order
  Sprint 1 狀態只有
  SUBMITTED → ACCEPTED → READY → PICKED_UP
  取消／放鳥在 Sprint 2 加入
end note
@enduml
